       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks like an error.\n\n- **Ordered dose:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Maximum for adults:** The usual limit is 3,200 mg/day for prescription use, given as no more than 800 mg per dose. This order is double the daily maximum and double the single-dose maximum.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. These risks apply even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nPlease tell me which of these you meant:\n1. **800 mg by mouth, four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum).\n2. **400\u2013600 mg by mouth, every 6 hours** (typical for pain or inflammation).\n3. **1600 mg per day in divided doses**, for example 400 mg four times daily.\n4. **1600 mg four times daily is intended.** If so, please confirm it, and I'll enter it with a note recording that you verified the dose. I'd advise against it.\n\nI'll enter the order once you reply."
